# No claim is used in more than one statement, so there are no claim lines.
# "wretched" is the one word that might shift. In P3, "the wretched will" could be read as the wicked will. In C1, P4 and C it means misery.
# P3 does not join two claims through that word. It only says the will is ineffective without power, so I list no bridge.
